   "text": "Kenneth M. Bruce Jr. asked how to build proper AI agents with the right guardrails and ability to follow in the age of AI. He said the future of artificial intelligence is changing how cybersecurity is approached and the humans who do it, describing a scenario of one cybersecurity analyst and about 1,000 AI agents doing the work.",
